The OPTIONS request is used to identify which HTTP methods a server or endpoint supports. To make an HTTP OPTIONS request given an HttpClient instance and a System.Uri object, use the System.Net.Http.HttpClient.SendAsync*?displayProperty=nameWithType method with the System.Net.Http.HttpMethod type set to HttpMethod.Options:

