Retrieving an Individual Attribute Node

To retrieve a single attribute node from an element, the System.Xml.XmlElement.GetAttributeNode*?displayProperty=nameWithType method is used. It returns an object of type XmlAttribute. Once you have an XmlAttribute, all the methods and properties available in the System.Xml.XmlAttribute?displayProperty=nameWithType class are available on that object, such as finding the OwnerElement.

