The method receives a reference to the [System.IObserver1?displayProperty=nameWithType](xref:System.IObserver1?displayProperty=nameWithType) interface. Store that reference in the observer collection from the previous step, then return the System.IDisposable unsubscriber implementation. The following example shows the Subscribe implementation in the TemperatureMonitor class.

