            Implements IObserver(Of Temperature)

• If the observer needs to unsubscribe before the provider calls [System.IObserver1.OnCompleted*?displayProperty=nameWithType](xref:System.IObserver1.OnCompleted*?displayProperty=nameWithType), define a private variable to hold the System.IDisposable returned by [System.IObservable1.Subscribe*?displayProperty=nameWithType](xref:System.IObservable1.Subscribe*?displayProperty=nameWithType), and define a subscription method.

The private variable unsubscriber stores the System.IDisposable object. The Subscribe method calls the provider's [System.IObservable1.Subscribe*](xref:System.IObservable1.Subscribe*) method and assigns the returned object to unsubscriber.

