❌ Unresponsive application

Unconditionally calling System.IO.Pipelines.PipeReader.AdvanceTo*?displayProperty=nameWithType with buffer.End in the examined position might result in the application becoming unresponsive when parsing a single message. The next call to System.IO.Pipelines.PipeReader.AdvanceTo*?displayProperty=nameWithType won't return until:

• There's more data written to the pipe.

• And the new data wasn't previously examined.

