 [System.Collections.Concurrent.Partitioner1.SupportsDynamicPartitions*](xref:System.Collections.Concurrent.Partitioner1.SupportsDynamicPartitions*)   Return true if you implement [System.Collections.Concurrent.Partitioner1.GetDynamicPartitions*](xref:System.Collections.Concurrent.Partitioner1.GetDynamicPartitions*), otherwise, false.

