In the preceding example, the first time each url is downloaded, its value is stored in the cache. The System.Threading.Tasks.Task.FromResult* method enables the DownloadStringAsync method to create [System.Threading.Tasks.Task1](xref:System.Threading.Tasks.Task1) objects that hold these pre-computed results. Subsequent calls to download the string return the cached values, and is much faster.

