    Imports System.Threading.Tasks
    Imports System.Threading.Tasks.Dataflow

• Add a [System.Threading.Tasks.Dataflow.BroadcastBlock1](xref:System.Threading.Tasks.Dataflow.BroadcastBlock1) data member to the Form1 class.

